<span begin="00:10.787" end="00:11.035">T</span><span begin="00:11.035" end="00:11.317">wi</span><span begin="00:11.338" end="00:11.778">tter</span><span begin="00:11.778" end="00:11.996">は</span><span begin="00:11.996" end="00:12.474">閉</span><span begin="00:12.474" end="00:12.692">じ</span><span begin="00:12.692" end="00:13.579">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">快要被感伤淹没</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka n sho u ni hi ta 'c chi ma u ka ra</span></p><p begin="00:14.226" end="00:20.666" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:14.226" end="00:14.763">棚の</span><span begin="00:14.763" end="00:15.299">上に</span><span begin="00:15.299" end="00:15.836">置いた</span><span begin="00:15.836" end="00:16.096">カ</span><span begin="00:16.096" end="00:16.514">メ</span><span begin="00:16.514" end="00:17.039">ラも</span> <span begin="00:17.234" end="00:17.648">今</span><span begin="00:17.648" end="00:18.181">距離を</span><span begin="00:18.181" end="00:18.661">置き</span><span begin="00:18.661" end="00:19.041">たい</span><span begin="00:19.041" end="00:19.238">く</span><span begin="00:19.238" end="00:19.809">ら</span><span begin="00:19.809" end="00:20.666">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽管相机已经束之高阁</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta na no u e ni o i ta ka me ra mo</span></p><p begin="00:20.666" end="00:26.537" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:20.666" end="00:21.101">僕</span><span begin="00:21.101" end="00:21.344">は</span><span begin="00:21.344" end="00:21.857">今日</span><span begin="00:21.857" end="00:22.322">全</span><span begin="00:22.322" end="00:22.560">て</span><span begin="00:22.560" end="00:23.355">失って</span> <span begin="00:23.602" end="00:23.947">一</span><span begin="00:23.947" end="00:24.207">日</span><span begin="00:24.207" end="00:24.709">中</span><span begin="00:24.709" end="00:25.379">泣いて</span><span begin="00:25.379" end="00:25.633">い</span><span begin="00:25.633" end="00:26.537">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我在今天失去了一切</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku wa kyo u su be te u shi na 't te</span></p><p begin="00:27.038" end="00:33.537" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:27.038" end="00:27.641">本当</span><span begin="00:27.641" end="00:27.918">の</span><span begin="00:27.918" end="00:28.143">気</span><span begin="00:28.143" end="00:28.539">持</span><span begin="00:28.539" end="00:28.718">ち</span><span begin="00:28.718" end="00:29.437">は</span> <span begin="00:29.595" end="00:30.028">やっ</span><span begin="00:30.028" end="00:30.386">ぱり</span><span begin="00:30.455" end="00:30.660">わ</span><span begin="00:30.660" end="00:31.080">か</span><span begin="00:31.080" end="00:31.233">ら</span><span begin="00:31.233" end="00:31.613">な</span><span begin="00:31.613" end="00:31.780">い</span><span begin="00:31.780" end="00:32.012">け</span><span begin="00:32.012" end="00:33.537">ど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然还是不知道</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho n to u no ki mo chi wa</span></p><p begin="00:33.537" end="00:39.558" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:33.537" end="00:34.139">君の</span><span begin="00:34.139" end="00:35.222">アルバムに</span><span begin="00:35.222" end="00:35.585">居る</span><span begin="00:35.585" end="00:36.095">僕を</span><span begin="00:36.230" end="00:36.745">全部</span> <span begin="00:36.745" end="00:37.332">消</span><span begin="00:37.332" end="00:37.549">し</span><span begin="00:37.549" end="00:38.043">た</span><span begin="00:38.043" end="00:38.210">ん</span><span begin="00:38.210" end="00:38.476">で</span><span begin="00:38.476" end="00:38.915">しょ</span><span begin="00:38.915" end="00:39.558">う</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但你一定很想</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no a ru ba mu ni i ru bo ku wo</span></p><p begin="00:39.558" end="00:46.125" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:39.558" end="00:39.914">シャッ</span><span begin="00:40.027" end="00:40.496">ター</span><span begin="00:40.496" end="00:40.723">が</span><span begin="00:40.723" end="00:41.179">落ち</span><span begin="00:41.179" end="00:41.635">る</span><span begin="00:41.635" end="00:42.070">みたい</span><span begin="00:42.070" end="00:42.540">に</span> <span begin="00:42.781" end="00:43.248">君を</span><span begin="00:43.248" end="00:43.714">切り</span><span begin="00:43.714" end="00:44.316">取って</span><span begin="00:44.316" end="00:44.876">恋に</span><span begin="00:44.876" end="00:45.295">落ち</span><span begin="00:45.295" end="00:46.125">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我就像按下快门的那个瞬间般</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sha 't ta a ga o chi ru mi ta i ni</span></p><p begin="00:46.125" end="00:51.953" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:46.125" end="00:46.708">心</span><span begin="00:46.708" end="00:47.076">の</span><span begin="00:47.076" end="00:48.118">アルバムに</span><span begin="00:48.118" end="00:48.444">全</span><span begin="00:48.444" end="00:48.913">部</span> <span begin="00:49.165" end="00:49.682">そっと</span><span begin="00:49.682" end="00:50.177">た</span><span begin="00:50.177" end="00:50.360">め</span><span begin="00:50.360" end="00:50.824">込</span><span begin="00:50.824" end="00:50.989">ん</span><span begin="00:50.989" end="00:51.179">で</span><span begin="00:51.179" end="00:51.953">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将有关你的一切</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ro no a ru ba mu ni ze n bu</span></p><p begin="00:51.953" end="00:58.834" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:51.953" end="00:52.536">だから</span><span begin="00:52.536" end="00:53.115">さ</span> <span begin="00:53.612" end="00:54.174">だから</span><span begin="00:54.174" end="00:54.675">さ</span> <span begin="00:55.032" end="00:55.884">仕草も</span><span begin="00:55.884" end="00:56.229">匂</span><span begin="00:56.229" end="00:56.609">いも</span><span begin="00:56.609" end="00:57.405">覚</span><span begin="00:57.405" end="00:57.876">え</span><span begin="00:57.876" end="00:58.419">てい</span><span begin="00:58.419" end="00:58.834">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以 所以</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ka ra sa da ka ra sa</span></p><p begin="00:58.834" end="01:05.486" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:58.834" end="00:59.231">シャッ</span><span begin="00:59.327" end="00:59.793">ター</span><span begin="00:59.793" end="01:00.143">を</span><span begin="01:00.143" end="01:00.751">切る</span><span begin="01:00.751" end="01:01.292">時間</span><span begin="01:01.292" end="01:01.666">も</span> <span begin="01:01.887" end="01:02.511">君に</span><span begin="01:02.511" end="01:03.170">触れて</span><span begin="01:03.170" end="01:03.876">いれば</span><span begin="01:03.876" end="01:04.479">良かっ</span><span begin="01:04.479" end="01:05.486">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果按下快门的那个瞬间</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sha 't ta a wo ki ru ji ka n mo</span></p><p begin="01:05.486" end="01:11.582" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="01:05.486" end="01:06.327">全ての</span><span begin="01:06.327" end="01:06.894">時間</span><span begin="01:06.894" end="01:07.230">を</span><span begin="01:07.230" end="01:07.628">君</span><span begin="01:07.628" end="01:08.076">だけに</span><span begin="01:08.469" end="01:08.811">使</span><span begin="01:08.811" end="01:09.278">え</span><span begin="01:09.278" end="01:09.563">ば</span><span begin="01:09.563" end="01:10.031">よ</span><span begin="01:10.031" end="01:10.322">かっ</span><span begin="01:10.322" end="01:11.582">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果所有的时间</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su be te no ji ka n wo</span></p><p begin="01:13.427" end="01:19.942" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="01:13.427" end="01:14.429">お決まりの</span><span begin="01:14.429" end="01:15.163">デート</span><